Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: wireless: mt76: describe Airoha offload links

Describe the NPU and Ethernet frame-engine phandles consumed by mt76 on
Airoha platforms. This also covers the existing EN7581 board references.

---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/wireless/mediatek,mt76.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/wireless/mediatek,mt76.yaml
@@ -72,6 +72,18 @@
     description:
       Phandle to the infrastructure bus fabric syscon node.
       This property is MT7622 specific
+
+  airoha,npu:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
+    description:
+      Airoha network processor providing transmit and receive queue offload
+      for this radio.
+
+  airoha,eth:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
+    description:
+      Airoha Ethernet frame engine providing hardware flow forwarding for
+      this radio.
 
   ieee80211-freq-limit: true
 
